    {
      "num": 2,
      "geez": "ነሥአ[ቶ]፡ ኢዮሰቡሔ፡ ወለተ፡ ንጉሥ፡ [ኢዮራም፡ እኅቱ፡ ለአካዝያስ፡ ለኢዮአስ፡ ወልደ፡ አካዝያስ፡] ሰረቀቶ፡\n            እማእከለ፡ ደቀቀ፡ ንጉሥ፡ እለ፡ ቀተሉ፡ ወለሐፃኒቱ፡ ወኀብአቶ፡ ውሳጢተ፡ ጽርሕ፡ እምጎቶልያ፡ ወኢቀተለቶ።",
      "translation": "And Josabee daughter of king Joram, sister of Ochozias, took Joas the son of her brother, and stole him from among the king's sons that were put to death, secreting him and his nurse in the bedchamber, and hid him from the face of Gotholia, and he was not slain.",
